  line: No, I live up in Treff, in the windmill. I heard the screams last night and
    came down to help. But I was already too late.
  option1:
    text: I'm sorry. You did all you could. Were there any survivors?
    next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 550128f2b67362a46a9bc068f6af777b, type: 2}
